        // via the raw-memory intrinsics) but gated on their own str_case need,
        // emitted in the migrated-helpers section — no longer in this str_search
        // bundle. The single shared body serves both arm64 AST + IR.
        // __fern_str_repeat is now a Fern runtime function (#2649): see
        // asmcore.rt_src_str_repeat, emitted (need-gated on str_repeat) in the
        // migrated-helpers section via the raw-memory intrinsics. The single
        // shared body serves both arm64 AST + IR. No longer in this bundle.
        // __fern_str_replace is now a Fern runtime function (#2649): see
        // asmcore.rt_src_str_replace, emitted (need-gated on str_replace) in the
        // migrated-helpers section via the raw-memory intrinsics. The single
        // shared body serves both arm64 AST + IR. No longer in this bundle.
        // __fern_chr is now a Fern runtime function (#2649) — the single shared
        // __fn___fern_chr body is emitted above via emit_runtime_fern_fn (the
        // raw-memory intrinsics), replacing both this register-ABI body and the
        // former stack-ABI IR wrapper.
